title: Console tabs carry no x: three consoles are listed by name, the tab's own menu offers Kill, and a console is ended from the menu or its trash button only
folders: rust-small
limit: 80
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: console: .* did not start
expect-log: console: .*bash.* in .*rust-small
expect-log: script: console tab 3 (\(current\) )?"[^"]*" card

wait 3000
console echo first console
wait 2000
term new bash
wait 2500
term new bash
wait 2500
mark a-three-tabs
wait 450
term report
term menu tab 2
wait 800
mark b-tab-menu-with-kill
wait 450
press escape
wait 500
term front 1
wait 800
mark c-first-in-front
wait 450
term kill 3
wait 1200
mark d-after-kill
wait 450
term report
console exit
wait 2000
quit
